{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_14_title", "source_sha256": "efa2f1e88d2528ee64c9abf479490703b5f11290e54e42ddd566bcc76f4f9ab1", "ja": "我が家へ", "zh": "回我家", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_14_synopsis", "source_sha256": "57802c645e0f29ab2b602df748ad0f45589678ae90ebab7edfe0a61246759288", "ja": "記念公演の全日程が終了。社長や小鳥、美咲\nとライブの感想を交わす中、プロデューサー\nはふとアイドル達に対して、親心のようなも\nのを覚える。確かな絆を胸に、リニューアル\nを終えた劇場へと凱旋するのだった。", "zh": "纪念公演的全部日程圆满结束。在与社长、小鸟和美咲交流演出感想之际，制作人不禁对偶像们生出一种如同父母般的情感。心中怀揣着真挚的羁绊，众人凯旋归来，回到了完成翻新的剧场。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_14_1000_102mis", "source_sha256": "4c615149e903c412066f79300d36551747c9b969b3d3e43562d334f5a1f14c93", "ja": "以上をもちまして、記念公演は\n終了となります。みなさま、忘れ物にお気をつけて……", "zh": "以上，纪念公演到此结束。请各位注意不要遗忘物品……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_14_1001_p", "source_sha256": "24730aa7a7e408e0be63b3c6b9c93d081c47cffa0d1cd499f0c26273d59a55a8", "ja": "……よし。\n青羽さん、お疲れさまでした！", "zh": "……好。\n青羽小姐，辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_14_1002_102mis", "source_sha256": "c58b9e6c3e92f244dcfab71d05c75fd85f6ff32d8fb9512a71b6ec627b1e1fec", "ja": "ふぅ～……{$P$}さん！\nお疲れさまです♪　はぁ……素敵なライブでしたね～。", "zh": "呼～……{$P$}先生！\n辛苦了♪ 哈啊……真是场精彩的演出呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_14_1003_102mis", "source_sha256": "187319f9f463b680ee7a140752543b0b797009b52bfeb7429062d3aaa769464c", "ja": "なんだか……アイドルのみんなともう一度出会って、\nもう一度好きになって……そんなフレッシュな感じの！", "zh": "总觉得……就像和偶像们再次相遇，\n又重新喜欢上她们一样……有种焕然一新的感觉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_14_1004_101kot", "source_sha256": "ec39f4e30286ec49ed5bf5d9df5c56a0f6dd9e02928ff174d56faf01f51653a3", "ja": "わかるわ、美咲ちゃんっ！　もし仮に……仮にね！\n私が、小さい女の子だったとして……。", "zh": "我懂的，美咲！要是假设……只是假设哦！\n如果我还是个小女孩的话……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_14_1005_101kot", "source_sha256": "bae701bcb669c67c5260b9fcd46e8e1afd0df6ec06940bf24773909e47f34f8e", "ja": "もし、今日のライブを見ていたら……\nアイドルになりたい！　って思ってたかも！", "zh": "如果今天看了这场演出……\n说不定也会想成为偶像！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_14_1006_p", "source_sha256": "1a695348e7481ae90226dc9e65b10c79dfd303afc8ef7498133c1f13be5faede", "ja": "フフ……ですよね！？　\nいいライブでしたよね！　フフフフ……！", "zh": "呵呵……对吧！？  \n是一场很棒的演出吧！呵呵呵呵……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_14_1007_101kot", "source_sha256": "d96e9ed965f256f5770050e1ce13ebbfb4151c921059ffac0a4e9f2121b12c3f", "ja": "あら……？　ふふっ。\n{$P$}さん、鼻高々ですね♪", "zh": "哎呀……？呵呵。\n{$P$}先生，一副得意洋洋的样子呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_14_1008_president", "source_sha256": "66132218a1c07aaabc8297cdb541e728162c738106788c71516f6b51d05753bc", "ja": "気持ちはわかるよ、君！　アイドル達はもちろん、\n自分達の力で、輝いている……だが！", "zh": "我明白你的心情！偶像们当然是凭借自己的力量在闪耀……但是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_14_1009_president", "source_sha256": "eaaeb35894805a4ddcde51e6f1c6ec99033f28b9c92d8b13c36f830cdc4db924", "ja": "そのアイドル達を陰に日向に支え、前を向いて\n歩かせたのは、他ならない君なのだからね！", "zh": "正因为是你在明里暗里支持着那些偶像，让她们能够昂首向前走啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_14_1010_p", "source_sha256": "a45a27373f353e2bfed1a4fc4f6773366fecebe7f390f8d71d60fc5fadf27e06", "ja": "うっ……そこまで言われると恥ずかしいな。\nでも、ありがとうございます！", "zh": "唔……被您这么夸奖怪不好意思的。\n不过，非常感谢您！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_14_1011_p", "source_sha256": "8ca9a1381228041d9aaeda09accf5cf08e2ad8f4f26a182d1787a0c165450d91", "ja": "みんなの事、見守ってきましたから。\nやっぱり感慨深いって言うか……じんわりきますね。", "zh": "因为我一直都在注视着大家啊。\n果然会觉得感慨万千……心里暖洋洋的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_14_1012_101kot", "source_sha256": "2f674adb02168fc87d96d50600332357965596b208a6904d9d982df6aea27f71", "ja": "まあ！　それって、もしかしたら……\n親心？　っていうものかも？", "zh": "哎呀！难道那就是……所谓的父母之心？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_14_1013_102mis", "source_sha256": "fe670fd80f35020235b50079fe0967f406c434df8a667004c338412c7e56d3b2", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、\nみんなのお父さん、って感じですよね♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生给人的感觉，就像是大家的爸爸一样呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_14_1014_president", "source_sha256": "65e22892421db66346150b68cc5a154fb557e16a389346002c126f5134d8aae1", "ja": "はっはっはっ。\nならば私はおじいさんかな。", "zh": "哈哈哈。\n那我就是老爷爷了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_14_1015_101kot", "source_sha256": "b09e8e9dd75793eabbb13635c58bd00727437b4445f9fdbb09a4338732d2dd3c", "ja": "あ、私はお姉さんですからね！　まだお姉さんで……\nい、いや、待って、待つのよ小鳥！", "zh": "啊，我可是姐姐哦！我还是姐姐……  \n不、不对，等等，等等，小鸟！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_14_1016_101kot", "source_sha256": "b62985f9d7922d1ddfb44ff2e69fde1e99085bd207fe979112bbdec1dfed8b69", "ja": "ここはお母さんに立候補したら……？\nきゃっ！　そんな、ダメよ小鳥、いきなりなんて……！", "zh": "要不我来竞选妈妈……？\n呀！不行啦，小鸟，怎么能突然说这种话……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_14_1017_102mis", "source_sha256": "ba689632a8b1cace66085bb75fa43bc16f27b49160bbfaffcae37bcd5a62d905", "ja": "劇場みんなが家族って、にぎやかで楽しそうですね♪\n私はやっぱり、妹ですかね。", "zh": "剧场里的大家都是一家人，热热闹闹的感觉真开心呢♪  \n我嘛，果然还是妹妹吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_14_1018_102mis", "source_sha256": "7b6e353693e78fde5dfd2b5b92ad52b9daf5a7041d77dc933266b33909579915", "ja": "お兄ちゃん？　なんて……ふふっ♪", "zh": "哥哥？开玩笑的……呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_14_1019_p", "source_sha256": "cf5807796664d8ca5d4d1862c6ea106de0ebd3ed284f902c0fce42eb2f279597", "ja": "（家族、か……確かに、そう言いたくなるほど、\nみんなやスタッフとの間には、温かい絆を感じる）", "zh": "（家人吗……确实，大家和工作人员之间有着温暖的羁绊，甚至让人想这样称呼他们。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0290_story_14_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0290_story_14_1020_p", "source_sha256": "85138fb19719f6a3e2fd73a842af6367801d8ccb3b4d2897ed975ba6fe791d0d", "ja": "（それなら劇場は、みんなの家かな……。\nよーし、リフォームしたての我が家に、凱旋だ！）", "zh": "（那样的话，剧场就是大家的家了吧……。好——向刚装修好的自家凯旋而归！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
